    <p>from faculty, and other related skills (Karp et al. 2012).</p>
    <p>Zeidenberg, Jenkins, and Calcagno (2007) found that</p>
    <p>community college students who enrolled in student</p>
    <p>success courses were more likely to persist, earn a</p>
    <p>credential, and transfer to a four-year institution than</p>
    <p>similar students who did not participate. Colleges can</p>
